":1,"title":"薄型EDLC","title_link":"https://product.tdk.com/ja/techlibrary/applicationnote/energy-harvest_edlc.html","text":" LEDフラッシュのアシスト電源などに多用されているTDKのEDLC TDKではリチウムイオン電池の製造技術を応用展開し、パウチ型の小型タイプに特化したEDLCを提供しています。TDKのEDLCは薄型・大容量・低インピーダンスを特長とし、LEDフラッシュ向けを初めとして、各種電源のアシストに多用されています。EDLCはウェアラブルデバイスやIoTデバイスの二次電源などとしても期待されており、さらなる薄型化が求められています。こうした先進ニーズに応えて、TDKでは厚さわずか0.45mm(Max.)という業界最薄クラスのEDLCを新開発しました(図1)。 図1　新開発の薄型EDLC(EDLC041720-050-2F-13)","image_url":"https://www.tdk.com/system/files/dam/image/TDK_logo_blue_1200_630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"TDK","service_icon":"https://product.tdk.com/themes/custom/tdkcom/src/favicons/TDK_Favicon_152x152_BT.png","from_url":"https://product.tdk.com/ja/techlibrary/applicationnote/energy-harvest_edlc.html","original_url":"https://product.tdk.com/ja/techlibrary/applicationnote/energy-harvest_edlc.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cn7oo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76c5f7fb-624e-436a-bac2-699e7122c57d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"組み込み向けで足付きとかでええんじゃないか","ts":"1620376928.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iQHP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7826d60-e9c7-4a0d-a7a8-1e851cc86e4a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ボタン電池の形状は規格の問題なので、昨今に合わせてもっと薄いの作ってもらえれば","ts":"1620376897.215000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BCBl6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2483ff31-ea77-41e0-a3bb-40d2c1b88521","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"コイン型というのもあるのか。こっちは1.2mmってのがある\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E5%BD%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%83%81%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A0%E9%9B%BB%E6%B1%A0\u003e","ts":"1620376865.214000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"